5 Conclusion
In this paper, we proposed a mathematical formulation that interpreted the diffusion process on SO(3) as a SDE in the Lie algebra. We subsequently solved the corresponding probability flow ODE through Picard iteration and derived a discretized update equation. Based on these formulations, we developed a parallelizable algorithm that eliminated the need to retrain existing deep learning models and accelerated the denoising process through parallel computation. The experimental results demonstrated the effectiveness and efficiency of our proposed method. Compared to the baseline approach, our methodology achieved a speedup of up to 4.9× without any degradation in accuracy.
